<title>USA: Hannibal Ltd buys SecureHealth Savings.</title>
<headline>Hannibal Ltd buys SecureHealth Savings.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hannibal Ltd said Thursday it acquired SecureHealth Savings Corp, a health services network, for about 8.1 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Hannibal distributes a line of natural medicines and health products.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
